enshots below are in order are from 4.4 dev 1 (correct), dev2 (correct), dev3 (issues) and dev4 (issues). I'd expect to see the same output when moving between different versions of the editor.\r\n\r\nThe lighting of the scene is consistent (just a single global sun light), no changes to code or scenes made between these screenshots, just opening the project in a different version of the editor.\r\n\r\n**4.4 Dev-1 (correct)**\r\n\r\n<img width=\"620\" alt=\"4 4-dev1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a07e67c-803e-45b9-95b4-e1c7657e6766\">\r\n\r\n**4.4 Dev-2 (correct)**\r\n\r\n<img width=\"616\" alt=\"4 4-dev2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe115380-ca23-4dd4-afc3-02106a04e0dd\">\r\n\r\n**4.4 Dev-3 (issues - darker crystals and ship, missing texture on asteroids)**\r\n\r\n<img width=\"617\" alt=\"4 4-dev3\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa07af3c-4944-40c4-9d89-b2b8a65b5b3d\">\r\n\r\n**4.4 Dev-4 (issues - darker crystals and ship, but texture is fixed on asteroids)**\r\n\r\n<img width=\"617\" alt=\"4 4-dev4\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a404faae-5ced-440a-b2b6-5ccd54e464f8\">\r\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP in Godot 4.4 Dev 2 (official) (NOTE: Dev 1 works but with load errors that aren't related to the bug, I think it's something to do with onedrive locally.).\r\n3. Run the scene and observe the single object and its shading, which is \"correct\" visually:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"48\" alt=\"repro 4 4 dev2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e817ac93-799c-41a9-88ee-3d01972f1d53\">\r\n\r\n5. Open the MRP in 4.4 Dev 4\r\n6. Run the scene and observe the difference / darker color shading, which appears \"incorrect\" (darker) visually.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"41\" alt=\"repro 4 4 dev4\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/deb72290-2223-4622-ade1-cd03b3d9ecf5\">\r\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Shader-Bug-Repro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17690231/Shader-Bug-Repro.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AlexanderParker","id":1546863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDY4NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1546863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexanderParker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99011/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}